# Changelog

We follow the CalVer (https://calver.org/) versioning scheme: YY.MINOR.MICRO.

26.22.0 (2026-11-02)
====================

* Report Sentry environment from config.json
* Improve error pages
* Ability for moderator to report users as spam
* Fix circular dependencies in settings
* Update toast errors for SSR
* Update delete project/component
* Show specific error toasts when disconnecting an ORCID
* Make it possible to edit metadata on previous versions of a preprint
* Preprint title incorrectly hyperlinked
* Update Angular dependencies and fix remaining security vulnerabilities
* Turn off source maps in production
* Cookie consent is not saved after accepting cookies
* Change maintenance mode wording
* Unable to duplicate a registration from overview page

26.21.0 (2026-10-08)
====================

* PB&S Release: PBS-26-19

26.20.0 (2026-10-01)
====================

* SSR Metrics

26.19.0 (2026-09-23)
====================

* Remove leave this view from top of registration VOLs
* OSF links do not include any content previews when shared
* Registrations resources page UI is limited to only ten items
* Registration without license returns 'Not Found'
* Project Overview page displays subjects and tags twice
* Social settings page displays translation keys instead of localized text
* Show Homepage Banner to Logged-Out Users
* Terms of Use Shown on View-Only Links
* Filter Sentry client-side errors in Angular-OSF
* Banner Incorrectly Displaying on Registries Discover Page

